MacHPSDR
========

MacHPSDR is a fork of LinHPSDR, a GTK3 SDR control application for HPSDR
hardware.

Original work:
    LinHPSDR
    Copyright (C) 2018 John Melton, G0ORX/N6LYT
    https://github.com/g0orx/linhpsdr

Modifications in this fork:
    Copyright (C) 2024-2026 Gleb Sushko (enthru)

This is a MODIFIED version of LinHPSDR. It has been renamed to MacHPSDR and
carries a number of changes and feature additions (macOS support, a WFM/RDS
demodulator, a single-window UI, skins, a fake test device, SoapySDR transmit,
and more). The full list of changes is in README.md ("Changelist for this
fork") and the detailed history is in this repository's git log.

